      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VALLETTA MOON (7) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (25.83) at Ballarat over 450m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Sure to be about the mark. PARIS MASH (2) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 6 lengths at this track (24.96). Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in five starts. Should be thereabouts. CANDY STRIDE (1) produced a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 425m behind Gray Grouper (24.85) in a Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Can measure up this time. HARTLAND ASH (6) did a good job to finish second last time out over 425m at this track (24.85) in a Maiden, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
